        </div>
        <div className="flex-1 max-w-md pb-2">
          <p className="text-sm text-on-surface-variant font-light leading-relaxed mb-5">Parenting is not a productivity problem. It is a presence problem. Neev does not try to make you faster — it tries to make you more <em className="font-serif text-on-surface">present</em>.</p>
          <div className="border-l-2 border-primary/30 pl-5">
